auA0JlWq8kO4qtuiV-rE_OlxkcAVnfhTRuAssjeR4oX8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKu2oYrQixU8RfWtKfTet79dymxEoTmJ9m3rub5AG_XrA&oe=6AA00C9B"}, {"file_name": "Screenshots_2560x1440_DD_redlight.png", "id": "885485973918344", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307470_885485977251677_236459379275901057_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gY0BIR6WnugQ7kNvwGfICfy&_nc_oc=Adru9oeIdw76smwhp2C402zZplbonB3RxfI99VbPr24crZHdREXjtWQDQnaIPE3WmxQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKwMfmchlHYwmAWa-tD18bLJyvJL-8rmDU3QyO4SRatjw&oe=6AA02201"}, {"file_name": "Screenshots_2560x1440_DD_treasurechest.png", "id": "1554385379036074", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300619_1554385382369407_6649834865537826538_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5BmvmzWcCYEQ7kNvwEAyxC7&_nc_oc=Adp41pJZ6ICWj12VcbQhe9eWcIuw3y6EonaLIR7WMj1REJhmVLWmInmWa5xC33JVoOA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKpJ5b78GgKuuMFYfIK5lJ-gf4apDtwZn-dZgUjfncJUQ&oe=6A9FFDF1"}, {"file_name": "Screenshots_2560x1440_DD_rouletteGun.png", "id": "861787259535773", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304162_861787262869106_4083471127808216396_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=B7f65kTkeVgQ7kNvwEFaSRr&_nc_oc=Adqoxl7j4NBKrZnn6QkyfY2bSLc6kgmhQEQh-TxT8Aig3h3zv3fNtookOJXg7LZTv1s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ4PiixXEma3icRuXB--lO1sfItJOEOwzcezdVo8XO3fg&oe=6AA00F83"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverLandscape_2560x1440_DD_08_goldmoon.png", "id": "1508503193997973", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308307_1508503200664639_4415398320502851739_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uyIZ5N755fsQ7kNvwGJRrGt&_nc_oc=Adoxmk45x2pVHOUeJBUlzWtFHId-99yDNLED2IefuCBy-YWPLr8kSZZZwEz71UUZI44&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJZEk8871E8ZBaUs4ujfUrFH8j7LteRc2m1GpRLovHV6Q&oe=6A9FFA56"}, "display_name": "Deadly Delivery", "keywords": ["Multiplayer", "Horror", "Company", "lethal", "coop"], "long_description": "# The Goldmoon Update is OUT NOW!\n\nIn Deadly Delivery, you and your fellow delivery goblins are tasked with delivering parcels into pitch-black mines full of... things. \nArmed with questionable equipment, you'll sneak, sprint, and scream your way through procedurally generated tunnels.\n{9656622597769756}\n\nJoin our discord to be part of the community and find other goblins to play with! discord.gg/vxaFQr9jqC\n\n\n\n# Features\n# \ud83d\udc80 Deadly Co-op Missions\n Team up with up to 3 other players in online co-op. Coordinate, deliver, and survive, or watch your coworkers get picked off one by one.\n{671974505659765}\n\n# \ud83d\udd26 Physics based VR Horror\n Built for VR with a physics based world, spatial audio, and proximity voice chat. \nHaul a variety of parcels, climb on other players or give them a slap of encouragement \n{4124201431128214}\n\n# \ud83d\udc79 Monsters With Personality\n Face off against terrifying entities, some may even look and act like your teammates. Learn their patterns, or feed them your friends.\n\n# \u26f0\ufe0f Progression\nLevel up, upgrade your gear, grab a pet, unlock cosmetics!\n", "short_description": "An online VR co-op horror game about delivering parcels into haunted mines. \nAvoid monsters, drop off packages, and pray you reach the quota! \nTeam up with up to 3 other delivery goblins, survive your shift and pay back your student loans."}]}, "developer_name": "Flat Head Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://deadlydelivery.com/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Flat Head Studio, Creature", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://deadlydelivery.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category"